    "official_asset_statement": "https://static.makehumancommunity.org/about/license.html",
    "source_license_distinction": "Only explicitly CC0 basemesh, adult female targets, face units, eyes and skin weights are reused. MakeHuman AGPL executable/source code is not included or executed.",
    "no_complete_hand_pose_asset_found": "The project resource review found no suitable complete authorized four-maneuver set; these poses are newly authored from the CC0 palm/finger/forearm topology."
  },
  "authored_changes": [
    "Supine adult torso and pillow, lower backrest; opaque chest/pelvis coverings and separate privacy abdomen cover",
    "Lift connected head and neck by .035m in illustrative scene; lower backrest by .05m, halve pillow thickness and reposition to prevent skull burial",
    "Continuous analytic pregnant skin mesh with subtle navel and matched raycast/height formula",
    "Paired knee contours under an opaque drape with Knees_flex morph",
    "Eight distinct left/right examiner hand poses using genuine palm/finger/forearm topology and short scrub cuffs",
    "Two independently controlled full belt loops and two repositionable transducers",
    "Unbranded extended preparation tray, hinged gel cap, pressable hand sanitizer, tissue and recording paper",
    "Integrated monitor controls, recessed paired sockets, loose keyed cable plugs, independent belt buckles, paper return marker and open recovery box",
    "U-shaped pleated privacy curtain with three real gather/extend panels and explicit open/closed transforms",
    "Loose privacy cloth envelope clears steep abdominal skin edges while retaining its existing root and coverage"
  ],
